### Listing expenses — GET /api/v1/expenses
# A page of the signed-in person's expenses and pending proposals, newest first. Needs an open session; no CSRF
# token, since it is a read.

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie a sign-in response sets — see session.http.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here

### Unfiltered — the default page, limit 50, offset 0.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by status — PENDING or RECORDED.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?status=PENDING
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by category.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?categoryId=1
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by a period — both days required, the last day included.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}
